    "deliverables": [
      "SOC 2: control testing status for security, availability, and change management; any noted exceptions and current remediation status; vulnerability management cadence and patch SLAs; incident response readiness and last-quarter exercises/results.",
      "GDPR: DSAR metrics and average response times; DPIA updates; subprocessor changes (if any) and notifications; cross-border transfer mechanisms and safeguards; data retention and deletion enforcement; breach notification status (no incidents reported unless otherwise noted).",
